# treadle 1
type Window class
	namespace Particles
	doc "The SDL window: a Local of it opens SDL video, a Width x Height window and a renderer synchronised with the display, and its destructor closes whatever was made. Run is the frame loop: events, a parallel step, the projection on named threads, and the points drawn in batches of Batch through Spans with SDL_RenderDrawPoints."

field mWindow C.SDL_Window*

field mRenderer C.SDL_Renderer*

field mStarted bool

field mFailed StringView
	doc "The step that failed; empty when all went well."

ctor w0001
	doc "Starts SDL video, opens the window and the renderer; on a failure it stops and keeps the name of the step in mFailed (SDL_GetError says why)."
sheet body
node a01 Entry
node a02 Call C.sdl2.SDL_SetMainReady
node a03 Get C.sdl2.SDL_INIT_VIDEO
node a04 Call C.sdl2.SDL_Init
